# Changelog

All notable changes to all gonemaster components will be documented in this file.

## [Unreleased]

### Added

 - Server: Environment variable and JSON config file support for database configuration (`GONEMASTER_DB_DRIVER`, `GONEMASTER_DB_DSN`, `--db-driver`, `--db-dsn`)
 - Server: SQLite persistent job store with versioned schema migrations and startup job recovery
 - Server: PostgreSQL and MariaDB/MySQL persistence backends with multi-dialect SQL abstraction, connection pooling, and integration test infrastructure (`make test-integration`, CI)
 - Server: Data retention — `--db-retention-days` / `GONEMASTER_DB_RETENTION_DAYS` runs an hourly background purge of completed jobs; `POST /api/v1/jobs/purge` and `gonemaster-client jobs purge` allow on-demand purging
 - Server: Public API at `/pub/api/v1/` exposes job submission and result lookup by short public ID without leaking internal UUIDs; suitable for reverse-proxy exposure

### Changed

 - Refactor SQL layer for multi-dialect support

## [v1.1.3] - 2026-03-13

### Added

 - Added Prometheus adapter for gonemaster-server with documentation

### Changed

 - Nagios plugin: prefer `-H/--hostname`, add `-w/--warning`, `-c/--critical`, and `-t/--timeout`, and keep legacy network/source flag aliases for compatibility
 - Better metrics view, with added query cache information
 - Improvements in the Nagios CLI to better conform to the structure of Nagios plugins
 - Updated npm dependencies for UI

## [v1.1.2] 2026-03-07

 **BREAKING CHANGE**: More spammy log entries consolidated

### Added

 - Zone13: New SPF test

### Changed

 - Zone12: Consolidated the CSYNC log messages
 - Consolidated output from the logs in Nameserver01, 02, 07, and 08

## [v1.1.1] - 2026-03-06

### Added

 - Added translations for tags with missing translations

### Changed

 - Lowered severity level of NAMESERVER_IP_WITHOUT_REVERSE to NOTICE
 - Bump codeberg.org/miekg/dns to 0.6.68
 - Fixed a bunch of regressions from logargs coherency
 - RNAME_MAIL_DOMAIN_INVALID now logs according to configured severity level
 - UDP can succeed even when a non-EDNS reply is slightly above 512 bytes (fixes BASIC tests)
 - Removed a large amount of stale translations

## [v1.1.0] - 2026-03-05

**BREAKING CHANGE** - log.args in JSON logs are now coherent, read docs/MIGRATION-1.1.md

### Added

 - DNSSEC19, test for badkeys, work from Hanno Böck, https://badkeys.info/, requires extra config
 - Added docs/MIGRATION-1.1.md to explain the new coherent log.args with mapping to legacy args

### Changed

 - **BREAKING CHANGE** - log.args in JSON logs are now coherent, read docs/MIGRATION-1.1.md
 - log.args has a contract version - 1.1
 - Updated tooling for automatic generation and verification of tags, and updated the tags documents
 - Bump codeberg.org/miekg/dns to v0.6.66 to fix MNAME bug
 - Use msgctxt for all translations
 - Only run Zone12 if zone exists
 - Swedish language updated, following upstream changes
 - RRSIG Expiration formatted as RFC3339 UTC
 - Removed stale translation and profile entries
 - Changed resolveCNAME to use a fresh inProgress map - fixed a DNSSEC validation bug
 - Update translation files with the new coherent tags

## [v1.0.6] - 2026-03-02

### Changed

- Fixed resolveCNAME to use a fresh inProgress map instead of sharing the parent's

## [v1.0.5] - 2026-03-01

### Added

 - Japanese translations to the engine and UI
 - Translations of the UI, with language selector
 - Dark mode / system, in the UI
 - Added OpenAPI coverage test
 - Browser notifications for finished jobs and batches

### Changed
 - Updated dependencies on Go and NPM
 - OpenAPI matches handlers.go
 - Use msgctxt for the translation tags, removed unneccessary comments form the po files
 - Fixed erranous N11_N11_NO_DNS tag from upstream
 - N16_HAS_NSID is now INFO instead of NOTICE

## [v1.0.4] - 2026-02-26

### Added

 - Test: Added Nameserver16 test case specification and implementation, NSID

### Changed

 - Docs: More descriptive test case listings

## [v1.0.3] - 2026-02-26

### Added

 - Test: Added Zone12 test case specification and implementation, CSYNC

### Changed

 - Test: Nameserver 13 queries DNSKEY instead of SOA (follow upstream change)
 - UI: Refactored App.svelte to match Svelte 4
 - Engine: Minor translation fixes
 - Engine: Fixed encoding explicit OPT RR when Z is set, so Z flags are now preserved
 - Engine: Fixed EDNS regression problem from migrating to DNS v2

## [v1.0.2] - 2026-02-24

### Added

 - CC license text to test case specifications

### Changed

 - Test:  Z11_NO_SPF_NON_MAIL_DOMAIN now emits domain to follow upstream difference from test specification
 - Engine: Now using miekg dns version 2
 - Tests: Now using Golang 1.25

## [v1.0.1] - 2026-02-22

### Added

 - Server: Fix parent cache memory retention in methodsv2
 - Server: Added SQLite persistent job store, with configuration options
 - Server: Startup recovery — "running" jobs are failed and "queued" jobs are re-enqueued on restart
 - Server: Added versioned schema migration runner
 - Server: `GONEMASTER_*` environment variable support for all configuration fields (override by CLI flags)
 - Server: `--config` JSON file support for persistent configuration
 - Docs: Canonical testcase specifications for all 73 implemented testcases under `docs/specifications/`
 - Docs: Per-module tag catalogs in `docs/specifications/tags/` generated from live code metadata
 - Tools: Spec validation tooling (`make spec-validate`, `make spec-check-tags`) for CI drift detection
 - Recursor: Add bailiwick filtering for trusted glue addresses
 - Recursor: Bound recurse cache growth to reduce long-run memory pressure
 - Recursor: Scope recurse cache by resolver context (root vs custom NS set)
 - Recursor: Add regression tests for cache isolation/limits and glue filtering

### Changed

 - Harmonized `--version` across programs
 - Recursor: Do not cache empty recurse responses

## [v1.0.0] - 2026-02-19

### Added

Initial release 1.0.0.

- Added --stop-level to CLI
- Added --sourceaddr and --sourceaddr6 options to CLI
- Added CLI cache options to CLI
- Added tag counters to CLI
- Added undelegated testing to CLI and Web UI
- Added the last needed DEBUG outputs from the engine

### Changed

 - Added the option to use the CLI without "--domain" if it is the last argument

